  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Serial Oceanographic Data",
  "description": "The serial oceanographic observations were carried out bimonthly on 175 fixed stations from 22 lines (East Sea; 8, South Sea : 7, West Sea ; 6 lines, Korea-Japan line ; 1) in Korean waters, since 1961, in February, April, June, August, October, and December. The water temperature, salinity, dissolved oxygen and meteorogical factors were recorded as well as nutrients data in some years and months.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To archive serial oceanographic observations.",
